	(gr_text "PCB FABRICATION REQUIREMENTS\n1. Manufacturer: JLCPCB (or equivalent)\n2. Base Material: JLC04161H-7628\n3. Surface Finish: OSP (Organic Solderability Preservative)\n4. Solder Mask: green\n5. Silkscreen: As per Gerber, top side only unless noted\n6. All dimensions are in millimeters\n7. Dimensions are for reference only - do not scale from drawing\n8. Fabricate strictly to data provided - Gerber files take precedence\n   over drawings\n9. No material or process substitutions without written approval\n10. Panelization is provided"
